{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong><br><i>The Archivist</i> Demo offers a glimpse into the eerie and immersive world of analog horror. Step into the shoes of a journalist who stumbles upon a desolate wooden house tied to mysterious VHS tapes. Each tape you uncover transports you into a different, twisted reality \u2014 from abandoned hospitals to forgotten forests. With every recording watched, the house itself grows more alive... and more hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo showcases the core mechanics and atmosphere of the full game: slow-burn psychological horror, exploration, puzzle-solving, and a unique VHS-glitch visual style. Your only tools are your flashlight, your courage, and your curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design:</strong><br>This demo highlights the foundational gameplay loop \u2014 finding tapes, watching them, and returning to the house as paranormal events intensify. It also gives players a taste of the game\u2019s environmental storytelling, tension-building sound design, and visual presentation designed to evoke dread through minimalism and realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Localization:</strong><br>The demo is currently available in English. Additional languages will be added in future updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119920?t=1761323799","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119920?t=1761323799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119920/3ce1b4627cfd449bdb5f4cb2ae7e0df5c858b9f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761323799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119920/3ce1b4627cfd449bdb5f4cb2ae7e0df5c858b9f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761323799","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Since it's a horror game there might be acts of torture, corpses covered or uncovered, blood and other elements that might be disturbing for some people and is inappropriate for people who are not adults."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong><br><i>The Archivist</i> Demo offers a glimpse into the eerie and immersive world of analog horror. Step into the shoes of a journalist who stumbles upon a desolate wooden house tied to mysterious VHS tapes. Each tape you uncover transports you into a different, twisted reality \u2014 from abandoned hospitals to forgotten forests. With every recording watched, the house itself grows more alive... and more hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo showcases the core mechanics and atmosphere of the full game: slow-burn psychological horror, exploration, puzzle-solving, and a unique VHS-glitch visual style. Your only tools are your flashlight, your courage, and your curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design:</strong><br>This demo highlights the foundational gameplay loop \u2014 finding tapes, watching them, and returning to the house as paranormal events intensify. It also gives players a taste of the game\u2019s environmental storytelling, tension-building sound design, and visual presentation designed to evoke dread through minimalism and realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Localization:</strong><br>The demo is currently available in English. Additional languages will be added in future updates.</p>","developers":["Archivist Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3984300","name":"The Archivist"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119920/2d59e17e5d3e51e95ee2452f5ae0fd8f2c02e68e/header.jpg?t=1761323799","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"min